        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ronaldo, Hernán Crespo, Fabio Cannavaro, Matias Almeyda, Domenico Morfeo\n- Organizations: Inter Milan, Kolkata 5s, Premier Futsal league\n- Events: 2002–03 Inter Milan season transfers\n- Roles: retired footballer, coach, marquee player\n\nFacts:\n- At the start of the 2002–03 Inter Milan season, Ronaldo departed from Inter Milan.\n- At the start of the 2002–03 Inter Milan season, Inter Milan signed Hernán Crespo.\n- Before that point in the 2002–03 Inter Milan season, Inter Milan had already acquired Fabio Cannavaro, Matias Almeyda, and Domenico Morfeo.\n- Hernán Jorge Crespo was born on 5 July 1975.\n- Hernán Crespo is a retired Argentine footballer.\n- Hernán Crespo is a coach.\n- Hernán Crespo is the marquee player for Kolkata 5s in the Premier Futsal league.",
